# Copy to .env.local for local dev:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Web3Forms — https://web3forms.com
# 1. Create Access Key with email: xbtbryan@gmail.com
# 2. Confirm the key in your inbox
# 3. Paste it below
# 4. For GitHub Pages, also add the same value as a repo Actions secret:
#    NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY
#
# Note: NEXT_PUBLIC_* keys are embedded in the static site (expected for Web3Forms).

NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=YOUR_ACCESS_KEY_HERE
